  "description": "XOTBAL crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C78 H80 Er7 N22 O32 3+,3(N1 O3 1-),8(C2 H3 N1),2(C1 H4 O1). From the CIF bond table, Er1 (Er) has 9 O neighbors; Er2 (Er) has 4 O neighbors; Er3 (Er) has 7 O neighbors; Er4 (Er) has 9 O neighbors; Er5 (Er) has 4 O neighbors; Er6 (Er) has 7 O neighbors; Er7 (Er) has 8 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 12 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.442-3.842 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 93.14-110.85°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Er7(L)6(μ3-OH)8(NO3)4]·(NO3)3·8CH3CN·2CH3OH. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 8 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 4 NO3 (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 3 NO3 (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 8 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)), 4 NO3 (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)), 3 NO3 (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
